5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I’m worried we’ll pick a plan and then stop speaking to each other. Can we agree to keep the door open, no matter what we choose?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Kenji"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Kenji: I’m worried we’ll pick a plan and then stop speaking to each other. Can we agree to keep the door open, no matter what we choose?""}]}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, Kenji. We must stay kind. Let us focus on what makes this corner pleasant for everyone, not just the bins.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I appreciate the sentiment, but kindness doesn’t fix a broken system. We need to know the actual time and cost burden before we commit to anything.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to make sure nobody gets stuck with the worst spot forever. We need a plan that’s actually fair for all five of us,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I hear your worries, friends. Before we choose, let us understand the true weight of this burden on each of our homes.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,- **Kenji**: I’ll look into the ward complaint log and the residents’ meeting statements to see where the friction really comes from.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I’ll check the station block’s bin house and their meeting minutes to see what living beside a permanent structure is truly like.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I’ll check the ward filing requirements and the supervised mornings on the next lane to calculate the exact time and effort involved.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I’ll check the measurements of the five frontages and the ward complaint log to see who’s been stuck with the worst spot.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"I will examine the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs, alongside the block ledger of refuse-point expenses, to understand our financial reality.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,- **Kenji**: I hope the logs show we can fix this without more shouting. I’ll be back with what I find.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will see if their experience offers any gentle lessons for us. I hope we can find a peaceful solution together.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"I’ll calculate the exact hours and costs. We need hard numbers, not just feelings, before we agree to anything.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I hope the measurements prove my point. If one gate is always the problem, we need to fix that unfairness right now.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,The numbers will tell us what we can truly afford. I trust we will find a path that respects every household’s means.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"- **Kenji**: I’ll be back soon. Let’s hope the answers help us stay friends, not just neighbors.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,- **Shizue**: I will return with what I learn. Let us keep our hearts open and our voices gentle as we seek this solution.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I will return with the data. We need facts to build a fair system, not just good intentions.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Asuka"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Asuka: I will return with the data. We need facts to build a fair system, not just good intentions.""}]}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,I’ll be back with the measurements. We need to see exactly who is carrying the heaviest load right now.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,I will return with the figures. Let us see if the numbers can guide us toward a solution that is both fair and sustainable for all.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
