69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"I vote for rotation. It honors our shared dignity, avoids the debt, and lets us move forward together in peace.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Kenji,,- **Kenji**: Five votes for rotation. It’s settled. Let’s go tell the ward office and get this fixed before the next argument starts.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
