75,3,4,talk,Kenji,,"It’s done. Five votes, one plan. Let’s go tell the ward office and get this sorted before the next argument starts.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Kenji"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Kenji**: It’s done. Five votes, one plan. Let’s go tell the ward office and get this sorted before the next argument starts.""}]}"
