77,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I confirm the vote. Rotation is adopted. We proceed to the ward office with the published schedule.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Rin,,I’m so happy we finally fixed this! I can’t wait to see the new schedule. Let’s all be nice to each other from now on!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Servas,,"A fair resolution, born of patience and shared wisdom. May this new rhythm bring lasting peace to our lane.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
